  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2205.02 Eligible Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2205.02 Eligible Projects. Projects that are eligible for grants shall:\n\n(a) Support waste reduction and diversion; and\n\n(b) Provide a demonstrated significant improvement in waste diversion methods that contributes to a reduction of wastes requiring disposal, pursuant to RSA 149-R:4, III.\n\nSource. #14633, eff 7-1-26, EXPIRES: 7-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw2200.html"
